  "schoolyard": 1,
  "schoolyard_use_notes": "This tree has dense, dark green foliage that can be used to teach about evergreen species and their adaptations. The leaves are scale-like and tightly pressed against the branches, offering a unique texture for sensory lessons. Its gnarled, twisting branches make for an interesting study in plant growth patterns and resilience in coastal environments. The tree produces small, round cones that can be used in lessons about seed dispersal and reproduction.",
